Small Metric. Massive Impact.

🚨 MTTR — Mean Time To Recovery

It measures how quickly a system is restored after a failure.

📉 Lower MTTR = Strong DevOps culture  
📈 Higher MTTR = Slow detection & recovery

How top teams reduce MTTR?  
🔔 Real-time alerts  
📊 Strong monitoring  
📜 Centralized logs  
🔁 Fast rollback strategies  
🤖 Automated CI/CD pipelines

💡 In production, failures are inevitable.  
But long downtime is not.

Great engineers don't just prevent failures…  
They recover faster. 🚀
